{"nodes":[{"id":"center","type":"text","text":"# King\n👑 Lancer's father and the main antagonist of Ch.1, guardian of the Eastern Fountain atop Card Castle.","x":-190,"y":-105,"width":420,"height":220,"color":"6"},{"id":"s0","type":"text","text":"**Lancer**\nHis son, whom he treats with indifference and uses as a hostage in the climax of Ch.1 — but whom, deep down, he would never have truly hurt.","x":-130,"y":-640,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s1","type":"text","text":"**Roaring Knight**\nHis new \"purpose\" after the Knight's arrival: he claims to serve him directly, and it's the Knight who pushes him toward villainy and self-proclaimed absolute rule over the Kingdom.","x":420,"y":-260,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s2","type":"text","text":"**Jevil**\nBefore his imprisonment, it was Jevil who told him about the glory of the Roaring Knight — the spark that ignited King's villainy.","x":420,"y":220,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s3","type":"text","text":"**What happened to the rest of the kings?**\nKing locked away the other three kings of the deck (hearts, diamonds, clubs) to seize absolute power alongside Lancer — the game doesn't go into much detail about what became of them beyond their imprisonment in the…","x":-130,"y":480,"width":280,"height":240,"color":"1"},{"id":"s0-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Lancer_Overworld.webp","x":-130,"y":-850,"width":148,"height":180},{"id":"s1-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/TheRoaringKnightDeltarune.webp","x":420,"y":-470,"width":158,"height":180},{"id":"s2-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Jevil.gif","x":420,"y":10,"width":183,"height":180},{"id":"center-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/King_face.png","x":-68,"y":-260,"width":157,"height":190}],"edges":[{"id":"e0","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e1","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s1","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e2","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s2","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e3_x0","fromNode":"s3","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s0","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e3","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s3","toSide":"bottom","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s0-img","fromNode":"s0-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s1-img","fromNode":"s1-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s2-img","fromNode":"s2-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s2","toSide":"top","color":"3"}]}